        {
            "id": "e0f818ef-f2d4-4c35-bf24-3a01ffa5d3aa",
            "build_id": "627a7797-2ea9-484e-9006-853b1bda818b",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-17T02:33:18.315331+00:00",
            "notes": "with this build, i usually never make it this late into a game, but on that rare occasion, the power is up to you and depends on how your game is going.\n\npersonally, I usually go for [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44), but it is up to you. even if you don't use the melee, it also gives decent mobility considering zenyatta has none\n\n [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) is good if you have better aim than me, honestly, the only reason I don't get this power more often is because I find it hard to pick heads from far away and behind all my teammates.\n\nif you decide to get  [Dual Harmony](item_6484b4c4-294c-410d-ae1d-8049f161df31), build for more AP. if you get  [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44), keep the build as is. \n\n [Dual Harmony](item_6484b4c4-294c-410d-ae1d-8049f161df31) impacts heals a ton, and sometimes you won't need to use orbs both at once. although, if you think your team needs tons more heals and your other support is lacking, then it isn't a bad boost to heals, but you as a zen would need to play much safer and focus on getting damage over picks to boost heals through  [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c).",
